
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>

  <%- include("partials/header") %>

  <main>
    <section class="page-banner">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">OUR WORK</p>
        <h1>Projects &amp; Experience</h1>
        <p>
          Engineering solutions designed to support performance,
          safety, reliability, and long-term asset value.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="projects-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">PROJECT PORTFOLIO</p>
          <h2>Our Project Portfolio</h2>
          <p>
            Explore our project portfolio as we document our engineering
            work and solutions across our service areas.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="project-grid">
          <article class="project-card">
            <img
              src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1541888946425-d81bb19240f5?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=900&amp;q=80"
              alt="Construction site with structural development"
              loading="lazy"
            >
            <div class="project-card-content">
              <span class="project-category">Civil Engineering</span>
              <h3>Civil Engineering Solutions</h3>
              <p>
                Engineering support for infrastructure and construction
                requirements, with an emphasis on quality and safety.
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="project-card">
            <img
              src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581092160562-40aa08e78837?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=900&amp;q=80"
              alt="Engineering professional working with technical equipment"
              loading="lazy"
            >
            <div class="project-card-content">
              <span class="project-category">Mechanical Engineering</span>
              <h3>Mechanical Systems Support</h3>
              <p>
                Engineering solutions focused on equipment performance,
                operational efficiency, and reliability.
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="project-card">
            <img
              src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581092580497-e0d23cbdf1dc?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=900&amp;q=80"
              alt="Industrial engineering and technical operations"
              loading="lazy"
            >
            <div class="project-card-content">
              <span class="project-category">Project Management</span>
              <h3>Project Delivery &amp; Coordination</h3>
              <p>
                A structured approach to coordinating project activities,
                resources, quality, and safety requirements.
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>

        <p class="project-note">
          The examples above are illustrative service categories, not
          verified completed projects. Confirmed company projects can
          be added to this portfolio as details become available.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="contact-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="contact-content">
          <p class="eyebrow">HAVE A PROJECT IN MIND?</p>
          <h2>Let's Discuss Your Engineering Needs</h2>
          <p>
            Contact our team to discuss your project requirements
            and explore possible solutions.
          </p>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">
            Contact Us <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <%- include("partials/footer") %>

</body>
</html>
